// Inbox rules that forward or redirect mail
// Attackers add forwarding rules to keep reading a mailbox after they lose access, or to hide replies
// from the victim.
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1114.003 Email Collection: Email Forwarding Rule
// Data: OfficeActivity (the Microsoft 365 connector in Microsoft Sentinel)
// Tuning: rules created in Outlook itself can appear as UpdateInboxRules with the details in another field.
// Response: remove the rule, check where mail went, and follow the compromised account runbook.
OfficeActivity
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| where Operation in ("New-InboxRule", "Set-InboxRule")
| where Parameters has_any ("ForwardTo", "RedirectTo", "ForwardAsAttachmentTo")
| project TimeGenerated, UserId, Operation, ClientIP, Parameters
| order by TimeGenerated desc
